Vivliostyle Core fork

Package: @vivliostyle/core
Version: 2.45.2-ogenkou.1
Based on Vivliostyle Core 2.45.2, upstream commit a90d13def0817ef4c67a6780cdbad80e460068db.

Copyright and license notices in the original source files remain applicable.
The fork adds in-memory document input, page reuse, focused pagination,
portable layout seeds, completed-paper transport, source position mapping,
page-content layout controls and layout-search optimizations.

